      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AWESOME BANDIT (8) continues to race in super honest form hitting the frame at three of 13 starts runs and has won two of last three, the latest winning (25.00) over 450m at Shepparton. Solid record at this trip including two wins. Super consistent and looks a key player. JOEY THE JET (2) produced a moderate run last time when eighth at this track over 400m behind Deadly Force (23.28) in a Grade 5 FIN. Was in the money the start prior. Key player if finds best. SIR SILVERTREE (7) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (22.71) at this track. Yet to win at the journey but has run some good races. Expected to give a good account. ELEVATE (1) scored last time and appeals as a top-three prospect.",
